(Bighra hua mizaj hai) x2<br />
Bighra hua mizaj hai hyder ke sher ka<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2</p>

<p>2. Chehra hai wal qamar ki ziyao se nur nur<br />
Aankho se jaankhta hua wan najal ka surur<br />
Bala qadi hai aaisi ke sharmae kohe toorr<br />
(Zulfe daraz aisi) x2<br />
Zulfe daraz aisi ke wal lail ka shaur<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2&nbsp;</p>

<p>3. Pyaasa hai sher ghat ka rasta na rokna<br />
Aankhe jukawo sher ki janib na dekhna<br />
Kaise bache ye jaan ye lazim hai sochna<br />
(Abbas hai jalaal mai) x2<br />
Abbas hai jalaal mai hargiz na tokna<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2&nbsp;</p>

<p>4. Tewar beta rahe hai qayamt uthayega<br />
Tege nazarse iski khuda hi bachayega<br />
Aaya jo samne koi who mara jayenga<br />
(Ek mashk me furat ko) x2<br />
Ek mashk me furat ko bharkar dikhaega<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2</p>

<p>5. Kabza hua furat par al kissa mukhtasar<br />
