(Baali sakina bacho se) x2<br />
Baali sakina bacho se kehti rahi udhar<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2</p>

<p>6. qaime ke dar par pyaasi sakina thi muntazar<br />
Jumbish alam ki dekh ke deti thi yeh khabar<br />
Tishna labo dua me tumhari hua asar<br />
(Who dekho aa raha hai) x2<br />
Wo dekho aa raha hai chacha ka alam nazar<br />
(Abbas aa rahe hai) x2</p>

<p>7. Aaya alam zurur magar khun me bharaa<br />
